{"synopsis":"Do-yul, putra pemimpin organisasi pembunuh bayaran terkuat di dunia, tiba-tiba pindah ke sebuah SMA di Korea!\n\nDatang sebagai murid pindahan tanpa uang sepeser pun, Do-yul menerima permintaan dari Dong-gu, seorang korban perundungan di sekolah. Dengan keterampilan bertarung luar biasa yang diwarisi dari keluarganya, ia mulai menumbangkan para pengganggu satu per satu!\n\n《War Against the Bullies》—kisah epik seorang pemuda yang berjuang untuk menjadi yang terkuat di dunia sekolah!","alternative_title":"고교정벌 : 일진과의 전쟁","author":"Pyo","artist":"Pyo","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"7c43a7b8-9635-4a09-9c4e-35ee873f8679","number":"61","chapter":"61","title":"","date":"2026-07-26","released":"2026-07-26","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3f1c4f35-aa8e-4ee5-bbd9-f0917d2c1497/chapter_ch_1/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3f1c4f35-aa8e-4ee5-bbd9-f0917d2c1497/chapter_ch_2/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3f1c4f35-aa8e-4ee5-bbd9-f0917d2c1497/chapter_ch_3/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3f1c4f35-aa8e-4ee5-bbd9-f0917d2c1497/chapter_ch_4/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3f1c4f35-aa8e-4ee5-bbd9-f0917d2c1497/chapter_ch_5/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3f1c4f35-aa8e-4ee5-bbd9-f0917d2c1497/chapter_ch_6/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3f1c4f35-aa8e-4ee5-bbd9-f0917d2c1497/chapter_ch_7/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3f1c4f35-aa8e-4ee5-bbd9-f0917d2c1497/chapter_ch_8/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3f1c4f35-aa8e-4ee5-bbd9-f0917d2c1497/chapter_ch_9/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3f1c4f35-aa8e-4ee5-bbd9-f0917d2c1497/chapter_ch_10/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3f1c4f35-aa8e-4ee5-bbd9-f0917d2c1497/chapter_ch_11/11.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3f1c4f35-aa8e-4ee5-bbd9-f0917d2c1497/chapter_ch_12/12.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3f1c4f35-aa8e-4ee5-bbd9-f0917d2c1497/chapter_ch_13/13.webp","htt